sults in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":212900,"global_rank":254620,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41241},{"name":"edorado93/Perceptron-Classifier-Hotel-Reviews","owner":"edorado93","html_url":"https://github.com/edorado93/Perceptron-Classifier-Hotel-Reviews","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Vanilla and Average Perceptrons for Hotel Reviews Classification","topics":["classifier","nlp","perceptron","python"],"score":212895,"global_rank":254648,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41242},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":212894,"global_rank":254658,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41243},{"name":"Reginatam429/python-functions-lab","owner":"Reginatam429","html_url":"https://github.com/Reginatam429/python-functions-lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212888,"global_rank":254670,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41244},{"name":"Reginatam429/python-data-structures-lab","owner":"Reginatam429","html_url":"https://github.com/Reginatam429/python-data-structures-lab","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212888,"global_rank":254671,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41245},{"name":"Reginatam429/python-control-flow-lab","owner":"Reginatam429","html_url":"https://github.com/Reginatam429/python-c